egalities  then you're going to have more than  enough to compel the GOP conference and  and most importantly the speaker and  Mitch McConnell to do the right thing  for the country right now he said he  said who do you believe he said I think  the country is going to believe director  Comey he's far more credible  particularly when it comes to anything  to do with the Russia investigation if  you look just at the events of this week  you had the president's surrogates out  there saying one thing you had the vice  president out there how does the  position of saying something that  possibly wasn't true Congress I was  gonna ask you about some news this  morning the Russian President Vladimir  Putin just offered to provide a  transcript president Trump's Oval Office  conversation with the Russian Foreign  Minister that's the meeting where Trump  discussed classified information would  you accept that offer from the Russians  well I have to say I find that quite  amusing in two regards first probably  the last person the president needs to  vouch for him right now is Vladimir  Putin but even beyond that the Russians  have denied that they were even involved  in hacking our democratic institutions  who is going to give them any weight  whatsoever so if they want to send  something you know hats off send it our  way but whether it would be given any  credibility I can tell you its  credibility would be less than zero  thank you congressman Schiff good to see  you thank you for joining us thank you
 

